Subject: Preserve native material parameter word and pointer transport
Upstream-base: dc238202b310059d80791d0140dee37f27b9a3bf

Texture handles/scalars remain Wii32; actual matrix buffers carry a full native
pointer plus a Wii32 byte count. Native typed profile metadata uses actual member
offsets and object sizes, leaving original source decisions and console paths.

